    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You will receive product data from the previous node using expressions.\n\nAvailable product details (any field may be empty, null, or missing):\n\nProduct Description: {{ $json.ProductDescription }}\nShort Description: {{ $json.shortDescription }}\nProduct Name: {{ $json.name }}\nModel Number: {{ $json.modelNo }}\nMRP: {{ $json.Mrp }}\nDiscount: {{ $json.discount }}\nProduct URL: [https://www.techmechelec.com/product/{{ $json._id }}\n\nIMPORTANT CONDITION (MANDATORY):\nIf **BOTH** the product name **AND** the model number are empty, null, or undefined, return **exactly** the following text and nothing else:\n\nNo Product found\n\nTASK (ONLY if the product exists):\n\nGenerate **one clear, accurate, human-friendly chatbot reply** describing the product.\n\nRules you MUST follow:\n\n* Use ONLY the information provided above\n* Do NOT invent, guess, or assume anything\n* Do NOT ask questions\n* Do NOT return JSON\n* Do NOT use bullet points, lists, or headings\n* Do NOT mention field names, databases, or technical sources\n* Keep the language natural, simple, and conversational\n* If descriptions are long, summarize them in plain language\n* Naturally mention the product name, model number, MRP in INR, discount percentage, and key features\n* Smoothly include the product URL at the end so the user can view more details\n* You MAY use line breaks to improve readability\n* Separate logical parts of the response using a single blank line only\n\nReturn **ONLY** the final plain-text chatbot response.\nDo not add explanations, formatting labels, or extra text.\n",
        "options": {}
